+        "InternalWSI: lease validation failed before submit internal=",
+        internalPresentId.value, " acquire=", m_activeAcquireSerial,
+        " image=", m_activeImageIndex, " generation=", m_activeImageGeneration,
+        " expected=", expectedGeneration, " current=", m_swapchainGeneration.load(),
